    "description": "SubTight uses a variation on the Creature algorithm to tighten sub-lows.",
    "source": "https://github.com/baconpaul/airwin2rack/blob/b6eef0af60cd32641b09837096e41bbcdb030341/res/awpdoc/SubTight.txt",
    "icon": "≋",
