    "description": "Discontapeity combines air modeling with tape-style overdrive.",
    "source": "https://github.com/baconpaul/airwin2rack/blob/b6eef0af60cd32641b09837096e41bbcdb030341/res/awpdoc/Discontapeity.txt",
