    "description": "TapeHack2 brings Airwindows tape to a new level.",
    "source": "https://github.com/baconpaul/airwin2rack/blob/b6eef0af60cd32641b09837096e41bbcdb030341/res/awpdoc/TapeHack2.txt",
    "icon": "◈",
